[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l019","ordinal":120065,"en":"Who are these Kyrgyz?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l020","ordinal":120066,"en":"Who are these Muslims?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l021","ordinal":120067,"en":"What is this thing called ‘unbeliever’?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l022","ordinal":120068,"en":"A wretched soul bears this torment;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l023","ordinal":120069,"en":"Even his daughter has become an enemy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l024","ordinal":120070,"en":"What sort of answer is she giving?”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l025","ordinal":120071,"en":"Then he struck Sarala upon the flank,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l026","ordinal":120072,"en":"And took Zulpukor in hand."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l027","ordinal":120073,"en":"“Let me finish them all together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l028","ordinal":120074,"en":"The daughter and her father;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l029","ordinal":120075,"en":"Let me slaughter them.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l030","ordinal":120076,"en":"Saying this, Alake,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l031","ordinal":120077,"en":"Raging, grim-faced,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l032","ordinal":120078,"en":"Attacked Burulcha."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l033","ordinal":120079,"en":"Burulcha, Esen Khan's daughter,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l034","ordinal":120080,"en":"When she saw Alake's expression,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l035","ordinal":120081,"en":"Flustered, trembling,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l036","ordinal":120082,"en":"Burulcha, in great haste,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l037","ordinal":120083,"en":"Fled, poor girl,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l038","ordinal":120084,"en":"Into her father's presence"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b003:l039","ordinal":120085,"en":"She entered, crying out."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l001","ordinal":120086,"en":"When he reached twelve,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l002","ordinal":120087,"en":"Almam worked off Sarala's fullness,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l003","ordinal":120088,"en":"Esen Khan of Middle Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l004","ordinal":120089,"en":"The hero drove in flight toward Deep Beijing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l006","ordinal":120090,"en":"That he strayed from the dark religion"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l007","ordinal":120091,"en":"Had its cause"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l008","ordinal":120092,"en":"In disputing a khanship with unbelievers."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l009","ordinal":120093,"en":"“The Chinese who have turned against me—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l010","ordinal":120094,"en":"How can I settle in a corner of their land?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l011","ordinal":120095,"en":"Rather than be khan of these Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l012","ordinal":120096,"en":"I will be only a slave of the Kyrgyz.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l013","ordinal":120097,"en":"Fleeing darkness, he found the sun;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l014","ordinal":120098,"en":"He found a caliph sultan."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l015","ordinal":120099,"en":"Disappointed in Kökchö,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l016","ordinal":120100,"en":"He came migrating to Talas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l017","ordinal":120101,"en":"Thus he became a companion"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l018","ordinal":120102,"en":"To Manas, Jakyp's only son."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l019","ordinal":120103,"en":"My precious mother Kanykei,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l020","ordinal":120104,"en":"Inside that mausoleum,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l021","ordinal":120105,"en":"Making every deed wondrous,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l022","ordinal":120106,"en":"Golden forelock and tasseled sash,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l023","ordinal":120107,"en":"The lion of Aziz Khan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l024","ordinal":120108,"en":"My godfather, the champion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l025","ordinal":120109,"en":"My mother had painted his likeness."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l026","ordinal":120110,"en":"Of the courser Aisarala,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l027","ordinal":120111,"en":"She painted its trotting in the picture."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l028","ordinal":120112,"en":"Disputing over faith, from Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l029","ordinal":120113,"en":"She painted Almam's arrival in the picture."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l030","ordinal":120114,"en":"When the man looked to his left,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l031","ordinal":120115,"en":"Wearing a coat of blue rep cloth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l032","ordinal":120116,"en":"Riding a horse like Kökala,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l033","ordinal":120117,"en":"With shrill cries and fierce shouts,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l034","ordinal":120118,"en":"My godfather, Khan Chubak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l035","ordinal":120119,"en":"He too was skilled among spearmen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l036","ordinal":120120,"en":"The finest of the tawny-gray ones,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l037","ordinal":120121,"en":"Alman of the Oigut,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l038","ordinal":120122,"en":"He too was a champion of the Islamic faith."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0563:b005:l039","ordinal":120123,"en":"Talas is not equal to Keng-Kol,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l001","ordinal":120124,"en":"Chubak is no less than Manas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l002","ordinal":120125,"en":"He too entered the caliph's presence and received a letter,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l003","ordinal":120126,"en":"Received a blessing from the prince,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l004","ordinal":120127,"en":"And was himself called a conquering lord."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l005","ordinal":120128,"en":"In Beijing's great battle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l006","ordinal":120129,"en":"He laid low whoever he met."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l007","ordinal":120130,"en":"Ezkara, khan of the Manchus,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l008","ordinal":120131,"en":"With his forty nobles at their head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l009","ordinal":120132,"en":"He captured alive without killing them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l010","ordinal":120133,"en":"When they came to grapple,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l011","ordinal":120134,"en":"He bent their spears,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l012","ordinal":120135,"en":"Took them all alive without killing them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l013","ordinal":120136,"en":"And loaded them upon their horses."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l014","ordinal":120137,"en":"Intending to go to Talas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l015","ordinal":120138,"en":"He presented the forty nobles,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l016","ordinal":120139,"en":"With Ezkara at their head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l017","ordinal":120140,"en":"He presented them to Manas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l018","ordinal":120141,"en":"Into Beijing, lying dark,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l019","ordinal":120142,"en":"He too went straight, extending his spear."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l020","ordinal":120143,"en":"The grim-looking Chinese and many Manchus,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l021","ordinal":120144,"en":"He exhausted them and broke their backs."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l022","ordinal":120145,"en":"Against this seething Kakan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l023","ordinal":120146,"en":"He charged, extending his spear."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l024","ordinal":120147,"en":"The swarming Chinese and many Manchus,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l025","ordinal":120148,"en":"Thus he broke their backs."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l026","ordinal":120149,"en":"My precious mother Kanykei,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l027","ordinal":120150,"en":"Having him mounted on Kökala,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l028","ordinal":120151,"en":"Having him clothed in blue rep,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l029","ordinal":120152,"en":"Making the Chinese cry out,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l030","ordinal":120153,"en":"Driving them toward Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l031","ordinal":120154,"en":"My godfather Chubak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l032","ordinal":120155,"en":"Thus she clearly portrayed him in the picture."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l034","ordinal":120156,"en":"When he looked this way again,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l035","ordinal":120157,"en":"The finest of sixty,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l036","ordinal":120158,"en":"The champion of forty jaisangs,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l037","ordinal":120159,"en":"Wearing a coat blue as iron,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l038","ordinal":120160,"en":"Riding a splendid courser,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b003:l039","ordinal":120161,"en":"Holding a sword in quiet readiness,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l001","ordinal":120162,"en":"The way he took his spear was something apart,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l002","ordinal":120163,"en":"Stealthy as a lion."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l003","ordinal":120164,"en":"He too was short of stature, broad of shoulder,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l004","ordinal":120165,"en":"Broad-chested, with shoulders flung back—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l005","ordinal":120166,"en":"He too had stately dark eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l006","ordinal":120167,"en":"The trusty support of the Karakalpaks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l007","ordinal":120168,"en":"Syrgak of my khan father, Khan Manas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l008","ordinal":120169,"en":"He never drew back from fire;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l009","ordinal":120170,"en":"He never recoiled a hair's breadth from death."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l010","ordinal":120171,"en":"He girded his waist firmly;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l011","ordinal":120172,"en":"If seventy thousand enemies came,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l012","ordinal":120173,"en":"He entered the attack with his coat thrown open."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l013","ordinal":120174,"en":"Light upon a horse, fit for a foal,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l014","ordinal":120175,"en":"Sleepless, alert upon the road,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l015","ordinal":120176,"en":"Never resting upon an elbow,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l016","ordinal":120177,"en":"Never taking even a brief nap."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l017","ordinal":120178,"en":"If an enemy leveled a weapon,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l018","ordinal":120179,"en":"None he met remained alive."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l019","ordinal":120180,"en":"His strength reached through this world."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l020","ordinal":120181,"en":"Manas and this wolf-man"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l021","ordinal":120182,"en":"Were sons of elder and younger brothers."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l022","ordinal":120183,"en":"The samovars are gold, the tea is cheap;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l023","ordinal":120184,"en":"Among the cities of Islam"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l024","ordinal":120185,"en":"There is no city like Samarkand."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l025","ordinal":120186,"en":"If you look at a hero in jousting,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l026","ordinal":120187,"en":"There is no young man like dear Syrgak."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l027","ordinal":120188,"en":"When Alman went scouting,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l028","ordinal":120189,"en":"All his giants were there."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l029","ordinal":120190,"en":"My khan father, departed for eternity,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l030","ordinal":120191,"en":"With the forty companions at their head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l031","ordinal":120192,"en":"The handful of the Islamic faithful"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l032","ordinal":120193,"en":"When he sent them out in a long line,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l033","ordinal":120194,"en":"Then, a saint with second sight,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l034","ordinal":120195,"en":"My godfather Almambet,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l035","ordinal":120196,"en":"When he chose Syrgak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l036","ordinal":120197,"en":"When they scattered the unbelievers' livestock,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l037","ordinal":120198,"en":"When he opened the way for Islam,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l038","ordinal":120199,"en":"Countless cattle gathered as customs dues,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0564:b004:l039","ordinal":120200,"en":"The myriad livestock in Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l001","ordinal":120201,"en":"When they raided and fled from Keng-Shor,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l002","ordinal":120202,"en":"No yearling or two-year-old left roaming the plain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l003","ordinal":120203,"en":"When Almam scattered every one,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l004","ordinal":120204,"en":"When, with loud cries, the horses"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l005","ordinal":120205,"en":"Were all driven away,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l006","ordinal":120206,"en":"Drizzle turning to snow in gusting wind,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l007","ordinal":120207,"en":"Cloudy by day, clear by night,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l008","ordinal":120208,"en":"When Almambet worked his weather magic,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l009","ordinal":120209,"en":"Castrated from a stallion to a gelding,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l010","ordinal":120210,"en":"A Karabair warhorse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l011","ordinal":120211,"en":"Sieve-lunged and copper-limbed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l012","ordinal":120212,"en":"When Kartküröng began leading the herd,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l014","ordinal":120213,"en":"The countless Chinese and myriad Manchus,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l015","ordinal":120214,"en":"Alööke's Konurbai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l016","ordinal":120215,"en":"Shypshaidar, Soorunduk's son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l017","ordinal":120216,"en":"All the wrestlers charging,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l018","ordinal":120217,"en":"Along the route Konurbai had scouted,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l019","ordinal":120218,"en":"With an army of many tens of thousands,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l020","ordinal":120219,"en":"When they charged and began battle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l021","ordinal":120220,"en":"The swift and skillful horseman,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l022","ordinal":120221,"en":"The most skilled among spearmen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l023","ordinal":120222,"en":"Konurbai, above them all,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l024","ordinal":120223,"en":"The finest in knowing the enemy's tricks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l025","ordinal":120224,"en":"When all the Chinese people swept forward,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l026","ordinal":120225,"en":"About to catch up,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l027","ordinal":120226,"en":"When they were about to wrest away the herd"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l028","ordinal":120227,"en":"And take it off,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l029","ordinal":120228,"en":"At that time Muzburchak and Khan Kökchö were absent;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l031","ordinal":120229,"en":"All the Muslims were absent."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l032","ordinal":120230,"en":"Refusing to give up that herd,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l033","ordinal":120231,"en":"Bloodied and steeped in blood,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l034","ordinal":120232,"en":"Standing their ground and fighting,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l035","ordinal":120233,"en":"Fighting in turn,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l036","ordinal":120234,"en":"Wheeling their horses away,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l037","ordinal":120235,"en":"Sparing none of their lives,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l038","ordinal":120236,"en":"The Chinese and many Manchus,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b003:l039","ordinal":120237,"en":"When the Chinese swarmed upon them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l001","ordinal":120238,"en":"Drawing bows like falling rain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l002","ordinal":120239,"en":"Firing shots like hail,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l003","ordinal":120240,"en":"When the Chinese swept forward,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l004","ordinal":120241,"en":"Khan Alman, seeing their onrush,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l005","ordinal":120242,"en":"Summoned his courage."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l006","ordinal":120243,"en":"Leaning down, he speared warriors,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l007","ordinal":120244,"en":"Spearing two or three at once."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l008","ordinal":120245,"en":"Seven, with the warrior Joloi at their head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l009","ordinal":120246,"en":"When he speared them in a row,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l010","ordinal":120247,"en":"What warriors those seven were!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l011","ordinal":120248,"en":"Spearing all seven in succession,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l012","ordinal":120249,"en":"What a lion my Alake was!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l013","ordinal":120250,"en":"The seven put a terrible strain upon him;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l014","ordinal":120251,"en":"His resources fled, his strength was gone,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l015","ordinal":120252,"en":"He slipped backward from his saddle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l016","ordinal":120253,"en":"His feet slipped from the stirrups."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l017","ordinal":120254,"en":"The white reins woven in okoro fashion"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l018","ordinal":120255,"en":"He could not grasp properly."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l019","ordinal":120256,"en":"Into the golden-footed stirrups"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l020","ordinal":120257,"en":"He could not set his feet."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l021","ordinal":120258,"en":"While Almam had not recovered his senses,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l022","ordinal":120259,"en":"A fellow skilled among spearmen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l023","ordinal":120260,"en":"A mighty fellow who knew the enemy's tricks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l025","ordinal":120261,"en":"Khan Konurbai, the precious lion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l026","ordinal":120262,"en":"Upon Almambet, havoc—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l027","ordinal":120263,"en":"That was the place he brought it."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l028","ordinal":120264,"en":"Striking Alkara with his whip,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l029","ordinal":120265,"en":"The warrior Konurbai arrived."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l030","ordinal":120266,"en":"Among the countless wrestlers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l031","ordinal":120267,"en":"When he reached Almam,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l032","ordinal":120268,"en":"From Sarala's back"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l033","ordinal":120269,"en":"He struck him down as he passed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l034","ordinal":120270,"en":"Thundering like Mount Opol,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l035","ordinal":120271,"en":"Almam the leopard, the precious lion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l036","ordinal":120272,"en":"Fell to the earth."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l037","ordinal":120273,"en":"When Almam fell from his horse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l038","ordinal":120274,"en":"He gave an order,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0565:b004:l039","ordinal":120275,"en":"Konurbai to his wrestler—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l001","ordinal":120276,"en":"He had given the command,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l002","ordinal":120277,"en":"Upon Almambet's head"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l003","ordinal":120278,"en":"He had brought this horror:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l004","ordinal":120279,"en":"“Surround the dismounted Burut"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l005","ordinal":120280,"en":"This very moment;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l006","ordinal":120281,"en":"To Karykan of Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l007","ordinal":120282,"en":"Take him bound and alive."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l008","ordinal":120283,"en":"Of half the realm of Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l009","ordinal":120284,"en":"Ask for the khan's rule."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l010","ordinal":120285,"en":"Into a dungeon forty rope-lengths deep,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l011","ordinal":120286,"en":"Binding both his hands,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l012","ordinal":120287,"en":"Gouging out both his eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l013","ordinal":120288,"en":"Into that pit they have dug,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l014","ordinal":120289,"en":"Take him and cast him alive."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l015","ordinal":120290,"en":"On the fool who fled to the Buruts,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l016","ordinal":120291,"en":"Take your revenge this way!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l017","ordinal":120292,"en":"His warriors heard the order;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l018","ordinal":120293,"en":"Swarming thick as ants,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l019","ordinal":120294,"en":"Teeming like mosquitoes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l020","ordinal":120295,"en":"The Chinese closed upon him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l021","ordinal":120296,"en":"Their lasso-men cast their lassos,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l022","ordinal":120297,"en":"Their spearmen thrust their spears;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l023","ordinal":120298,"en":"Mail-clad men with iron ropes"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l024","ordinal":120299,"en":"Surrounded my Almam,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l025","ordinal":120300,"en":"All those dagger-handed men."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l026","ordinal":120301,"en":"When the Chinese pressed him hard,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l027","ordinal":120302,"en":"He had no cliff where geese wheeled,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l028","ordinal":120303,"en":"To stand as his shelter,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l029","ordinal":120304,"en":"To break him free—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l030","ordinal":120305,"en":"No mountain, Manas the leopard;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l031","ordinal":120306,"en":"No Chubak, Akbaltai's son;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l032","ordinal":120307,"en":"No Ajybai, no Bakai khan;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l033","ordinal":120308,"en":"None of the forty heroes."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l034","ordinal":120309,"en":"Your lion Almam lamented,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l035","ordinal":120310,"en":"Standing there among the Chinese!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l036","ordinal":120311,"en":"“Their horses, raided and driven off,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l037","ordinal":120312,"en":"It seems I came to divide;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l038","ordinal":120313,"en":"My death has come from the infidels;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b003:l039","ordinal":120314,"en":"With my blood spilled here,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b004:l001","ordinal":120315,"en":"It seems I came to die,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b004:l002","ordinal":120316,"en":"Humiliation no human ever sees—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b004:l003","ordinal":120317,"en":"It seems I came to see it.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b004:l004","ordinal":120318,"en":"Giving his last wishes, reciting the creed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b004:l005","ordinal":120319,"en":"Despairing of life, saying, “I am lost,”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0566:b004:l006","ordinal":120320,"en":"He fought without yielding;"}]
